   "description": "Velini Watches’ third collection, the Parc Fermé, takes its name from the world of motorsport. In Formula 1 and other racing series, Parc Fermé (French for “closed park”) is the third and most decisive stage: the secure zone where cars are locked down before and after the race. Once inside, no more adjustments are allowed — performance is frozen, and only discipline, timing, and skill determine the result. In the same way, the Parc Fermé chronograph marks the third stage in Velini’s journey. It reflects a new level of maturity and refinement — bold in design, precise in function, and crafted to capture decisive moments. Featuring a 37.5mm stainless-steel case, domed sapphire crystal, the Seiko VK64 meca-quartz movement, and refined finishing, the Parc Fermé stands as a symbol of control and anticipation, where every second counts. Features: Case material: Stainless steel 316L Case diameter: 37.5mm Lug to lug: 46m Thickness: 12.5mm (with crystal), 10.5mm (without crystal) Lug width: 20mm Glass: Domed sapphire with double anti-reflective coating Movement: Seiko VK64 meca-quartz chronograph Water resistance: 50m (5ATM) Strap: 20mm Palm Pattern Leather Delivery & Warranty UAE Delivery: 1-2 working days Worldwide Delivery: 4-8 working days Warranty: Coverage: Your Velini Watch is covered for 2 years from the date of purchase against any manufacturer defects. Please Note: This warranty does not cover damage resulting from misuse, accidents, or negligence. Water Resistance: Rated at 5 ATM — suitable for everyday use, handwashing, and light splashes, but not for swimming or diving.",
