   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "In celebration of the 52nd Emirati National Day, this exceptional timepiece is a tribute to the heritage of the United Arab Emirates. Made in a limited run of just 52 pieces, it proudly showcases a sunburst green dial with the number 6 in Eastern Arabic numerals, exuding elegance and timeless appea l . Each watch is uniquely numbered from 1-52, adding an extra layer of exclusivity. The Dark Green Saffiano strap, a result of a special collaboration with Opto Watch Co, not only ensures ultimate comfort but also infuses an extra touch of sophistication into this exquisite collector's item. Crafted to be easy to clean, remarkably scratch-resistant, and highly durable, it perfectly complements the watch's elegance Note: orders will be shipped starting November 18th and onwards.",
